    "据 Microsoft 介绍，这项技能可用于评估 Azure Kubernetes 服务（AKS）的节点自动预配准备情况，分析工作负载的节点分布和存储成本，并排查节点伸缩瓶颈及缩容受阻的原因。",
    "Microsoft describes this skill as a way to assess Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) node auto-provisioning readiness, analyze workload placement and storage costs, and diagnose node scaling bottlenecks and blocked scale-downs."
